B.a2f=new A.i1("Harmattan","assets/portfolio/harmattan_cover.webp","A multilingual educational web experience about the Harmattan wind, built with semantic HTML and modern CSS. It demonstrates responsive layout, accessibility-minded content structure, and CSS-only theming and interactions.","https://github.com/koidioble/harmattan",null,"https://koidioble.github.io/harmattan/","Live","Harmattan pairs two things in one project: a factually-researched explainer on the real Harmattan wind \u2014 its formation, and its impact on health, aviation, agriculture, and the regions it crosses \u2014 and a UI-patterns playground demonstrating what pure CSS can still do without a framework. Every fact is sourced and cited; every interactive pattern (theme switch, language switch, modal, animated chart) runs on CSS alone, no JavaScript anywhere.",B.Ml,B.a2b,B.WL,B.PS,B.Tb)
