B.a2k=new A.i1("Ma Cacaoy\xe8re","assets/portfolio/ma_cacaoyere_cover.webp","A field-data collection system for cacao producers: a Flutter mobile app for agents and a TypeScript admin dashboard for coordinators, backed by Supabase authentication, PostgreSQL data, storage, and real-time updates.",null,null,"https://admin-novact.web.app","Live","Ma Cacaoy\xe8re supports cacao-producer field operations in West Africa. I built a Flutter application for agents to capture producer and survey data, along with a web admin dashboard for coordinators to review and manage that information. The system uses Supabase for authentication, PostgreSQL-backed data, storage, and real-time updates; the dashboard is deployed through Firebase Hosting.",B.Mk,B.a2c,B.Qx,B.W6,B.Sr)
